    <title>Vol.19 没有人会来，但这正是自由的开始｜高敏感觉醒三部曲（上）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69c3df39565a991256d79a25</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69c3df39565a991256d79a25</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 25 Mar 2026 13:15:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我们总是期待那个「灵魂双胞胎」能带着伞准时降临，却忘了，真正的自由，是从承认「没有人会来」开始。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌿</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目你会听到：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="34">00:34</a> 一场生命觉醒之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="139">02:19</a> 我给自己造了一个「Q弹泡泡」🫧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="324">05:24</a> 一个极其隐秘的渴望</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="404">06:44</a> 白雪公主、董竹君与衣柜上的小纸条</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="521">08:41</a> 独立女性：在追求自立自强之外，还有什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="588">09:48</a>小学一年级，站在走廊等伞的小女孩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="746">12:26</a> 给妈妈做面部 SPA 的那个晚上</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="821">13:41</a> 深海级的爱，撞上了浅滩级的回应</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1148">19:08</a> 兰花与蒲公英</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> 没有人会来 No one is coming</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1643">27:23</a> 把「爱的开关」收回自己的掌心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1688">28:08</a> 3个「自我关怀」小练习</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2016">33:36</a> 一个小彩蛋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2155">35:55</a> 原来，我就是自己的伞</span></p><span></span><p><span>📖提到的书：</span></p><span></span><p><span>村上春树《海边的卡夫卡》</span></p><span></span><p><span>董竹君《我的一个世纪》</span></p><span></span><p><span>余华《胆小如鼠》</span></p><span></span><p><span>🥰谢谢收听，欢迎留言或分享</span></p><span></span><p><span>👧在哪里还可以看到主播</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：依然的疗愈森林</span></p><span></span><p><span>私人微信：yiranhyy（请备注：小宇宙/网易云/苹果听友）</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果对播客有什么感想，或沟通合作可发邮件到：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="mailto:26162636@qq.com"><span>26162636@qq.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>📻本节目收听方式：</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙｜苹果播客｜网易云音乐</span></p>]]></description>
