    <title>Vol.17 少一点头脑分析，多一点身体感受</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69baa87c690ca3160f380e93</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69baa87c690ca3160f380e93</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 18 Mar 2026 13:35:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>疗愈森林第17期节目，和你聊聊，提升决策力和幸福感的「秘方」：少一点头脑分析，多一点身体感受。</span><br><span></span><br><span>在这个信息过载的时代，我们的头脑往往超负荷运转，却忘了身体才是最诚实的向导。</span><br><span></span><br><span>本期节目，让我们一起找回那份遗失的感知力。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🍃</span></p><span></span><p><span>你会听到：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">01:10</a></span></strong><span> 为什么「消失」了两个多月</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a></span></strong><span> 故事一｜参加上海叙事工作坊</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="455">07:35</a></span></strong><span> 故事二｜重启公众号写作</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="638">10:38</a></span></strong><span> 故事三｜和小学好友去听F4演唱会</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1002">16:42</a></span></strong><span> 具身认知理论揭秘：为什么身体比头脑更智慧？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1258">20:58</a></span></strong><span> 分享3个「与身体联结」的小锦囊</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1278">21:18</a></span></strong><span> 锦囊1：决策红绿灯（适用于日常决策）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1342">22:22</a></span></strong><span> 锦囊2: 5-4-3-2-1 感官着陆法（适用于被情绪淹没时）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1476">24:36</a></span></strong><span> 锦囊3: 跟随身体的自由书写（适用于生活/创作灵感枯竭时）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1553">25:53</a></span></strong><span> 依然原创小诗分享：《听，身体想对你说的话》</span><br><span></span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵</span></p><span></span><p><span>hideyuki hashimoto-Shin</span></p><span></span><p><span>魏诗莹《吐露空空》</span><br><span></span></p><span></span><p><span>🍃【节目简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌳一档关于「心灵疗愈+自我成长」的独白播客。</span></p><span></span><p><span>📒一本守护高敏感人群身心健康的随身指南。</span></p><span></span><p><span>融合后现代心理学+人文哲学视角，和你分享真实、温暖、疗愈的生命故事和人生感悟，陪你持续自我探索-自我疗愈-自我成长，活出自己渴望的模样。</span></p><span></span><p><span>「世上只有一种真正的英雄主义，就是看清生活的真相后，依然热爱生活。」</span></p><span></span><p><span>让我们一起，疗愈心灵，活出自己✨</span><br><span></span></p><span></span><p><span>👧【关于主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>依然Emily</span><br><span></span></p><span></span><p><span>出生在海边的89年高敏感INFP</span></p><span></span><p><span>定居广州的潮汕姿娘，天蝎座</span></p><span></span><p><span>左手内容创作，右手咨询教练</span></p><span></span><p><span>践行心灵写作+自我成长20年</span></p><span></span><p><span>正在养育一个5岁高敏感男孩</span><br><span></span></p><span></span><p><span>叙事取向的生涯咨询师</span></p><span></span><p><span>盖洛普全球认证优势教练</span></p><span></span><p><span>前南方报业集团记者/编辑</span><br><span></span></p><span></span><p><span>📮【联系方式】</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果对播客有什么感想，或沟通合作可发邮件到：</span></p><span></span><p><span>26162636@qq.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：依然的疗愈森林</span></p><span></span><p><span>依然微信：yiranhyy（请注明苹果/小宇宙/网易云听友）</span></p>]]></description>
