    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>疗愈森林第14期节目，和你聊聊，如何跟自己的完美主义和解，停止等待，拥抱当下。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🍃</span></p><span></span><p><span>你会听到：</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="48">00:48</a> 年度小结是一场和自己的心灵约会</span></p><span></span><p><span>2. <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="336">05:36</a> 空缺的五年日记本，带来的年度启示</span></p><span></span><p><span>3. <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="858">14:18</a> “我们娴熟于为生活作准备，却并不擅长于生活。”（一行禅师）</span></p><span></span><p><span>4. <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="886">14:46</a> 完美不仅是优秀的敌人，也是幸福的敌人</span></p><span></span><p><span>5. <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1135">18:55</a> 一盒过期的名贵燕窝</span></p><span></span><p><span>6. <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1206">20:06</a> &nbsp;一个错过的心动恋人</span></p><span></span><p><span>7. <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1436">23:56</a> 一个不复再见的青春友人</span></p><span></span><p><span>8. <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1615">26:55</a> “生命只存在于当下此刻，回归当下，就是回归生命。”（一行禅师）</span></p><span></span><p><span>9. <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1652">27:32</a> 一条鱼儿寻找海洋的故事（《心灵奇旅》）</span></p><span></span><p><span>10. <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1795">29:55</a> 3个“反完美主义”小练习：修改咒语、不完美日记、5%行动</span></p><span></span><p><span>11. <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2127">35:27</a> “昨天是历史，明天是谜团，而今天是礼物，所以才叫 present。”（《功夫熊猫》）</span></p><span></span><p><span>12. <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2148">35:48</a> 诗歌分享：《此刻》（博尔赫斯）</span></p><span></span><p><span>📚提到的书：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《5%改变》李松蔚</span></p><span></span><p><span>《微习惯 : 简单到不可能失败的自我管理法则》[美]斯蒂芬·盖斯</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎬提到的电影：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《练习曲》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《心灵奇旅》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《功夫熊猫》</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵插曲：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《自由が丘》《流逝的岁月》《日出》JINBAO</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Thought of You》岩崎太整</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵片尾曲：《Bedtime stroy》欧阳娜娜&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><s